# S20: Command Palette + Keyboard Shortcuts

## Objective

Power-user UX: `⌘K` / `Ctrl+K` opens a fuzzy-search command palette. Navigate
chats, boards, apps; run quick actions (create chat, open gate, run task). Lives in
the organization layer — cascades to all apps automatically. Keyboard-first
interaction model for the tech-company-in-a-box audience.

## Location

`organization/app/components/CommandPalette.vue` — auto-imported in all apps.
`organization/app/composables/useCommandPalette.ts` — commands registry.

## Commands (MVP)

- Go to chat: `c` → list recent chats
- Go to board: `b` → list boards
- Switch app: `a` → navigate to :3003 / :3004 / :3005
- Create chat: opens new chat immediately
- Open gate on current board (if applicable)
- Run task: opens run dialog with task picker
- Open docs: navigate to :3000

